<mxfile host="drawio" version="24.7.17"><diagram id="03-lista-de-espera-e-encaixe" name="03-lista-de-espera-e-encaixe"><mxGraphModel dx="800" dy="600" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nhide footbox\nskinparam sequence {\n    ArrowColor Black\n    LifeLineBorderColor Gray\n    MessageAlign center\n}\nskinparam participant {\n    BorderColor transparent\n    FontColor White\n    Padding 20\n}\n\nactor \&quot;Agendador\\n(Rotina)\&quot; as Cron\nactor \&quot;Cliente\&quot; as User\n\nparticipant \&quot;WebFrontend\&quot; as Tela #BE2C2E\nparticipant \&quot;ListaEsperaAppService\&quot; as Control #87A446\nparticipant \&quot;MySQLRepository\&quot; as Repo #E76F26\nparticipant \&quot;Lista de Espera\&quot; as Fila #5B9BD5\nparticipant \&quot;Disponibilidade\&quot; as Disp #5B9BD5\nparticipant \&quot;Oferta de Encaixe\&quot; as Oferta #5B9BD5\nparticipant \&quot;Agendamento\&quot; as Agend #5B9BD5\nparticipant \&quot;ComunicacaoAppService\&quot; as ComService #5B9BD5\nparticipant \&quot;Notificação\&quot; as Notif #5B9BD5\nparticipant \&quot;NotificationServiceAdapter\&quot; as NotifAdapter #F4B324\n\n== Oferecer Encaixe (UC-053) ==\n\nCron -&gt; Control: processarFilaEspera()\nactivate Control #87A446\n\nControl -&gt; Repo: buscar()\nactivate Repo #E76F26\nRepo --&gt; Control: Lista de Espera\ndeactivate Repo\n\nControl -&gt; Fila: candidatosPara(inicio, fim)\nactivate Fila #5B9BD5\nFila --&gt; Control: Lista&lt;Inscrição&gt;\ndeactivate Fila\n\nControl -&gt; Oferta **: &lt;&lt;create&gt;&gt; (Situação = Pendente)\nControl -&gt; Repo: salvar(Oferta de Encaixe)\nactivate Repo #E76F26\nRepo --&gt; Control: void\ndeactivate Repo\n\nControl -&gt; ComService: notificar()\nactivate ComService #5B9BD5\n\nComService -&gt; Notif **: &lt;&lt;create&gt;&gt;\nComService -&gt; NotifAdapter: enviar(Notificação)\nactivate NotifAdapter #F4B324\nNotifAdapter --&gt; ComService: void\ndeactivate NotifAdapter\n\nComService -&gt; Notif: registrarSituaçãoEnvio()\nactivate Notif #5B9BD5\nNotif --&gt; ComService: void\ndeactivate Notif\n\nComService --&gt; Control: void\ndeactivate ComService\n\ndeactivate Control\n\n== Responder ou Expirar (UC-047 / UC-054) ==\n\nalt Cliente aceita (UC-047)\n    User -&gt; Tela: aceitarOferta()\n    activate Tela #BE2C2E\n    Tela -&gt; Control: processarAceite()\n    activate Control #87A446\n    \n    Control -&gt; Oferta: éVálida(agora)\n    activate Oferta #5B9BD5\n    Oferta --&gt; Control: true\n    deactivate Oferta\n    \n    Control -&gt; Repo: buscar()\n    activate Repo #E76F26\n    Repo --&gt; Control: Disponibilidade\n    deactivate Repo\n    \n    Control -&gt; Disp: contém(dataHora)\n    activate Disp #5B9BD5\n    Disp --&gt; Control: Boolean\n    deactivate Disp\n    \n    alt Horário Livre (Boolean = true)\n        Control -&gt; Oferta: aceitar()\n        activate Oferta #5B9BD5\n        Oferta --&gt; Control: void (Situação = Aceita)\n        deactivate Oferta\n        \n        Control -&gt; Agend **: &lt;&lt;create&gt;&gt; (Gera após aceitação)\n        \n        Control -&gt; Repo: salvar(Oferta de Encaixe)\n        activate Repo #E76F26\n        Repo --&gt; Control: void\n        deactivate Repo\n        \n        Control -&gt; Repo: salvar(Agendamento)\n        activate Repo #E76F26\n        Repo --&gt; Control: void\n        deactivate Repo\n        \n        Control --&gt; Tela: sucesso\n        Tela --&gt; User: exibirConfirmação()\n    else Horário Ocupado (Boolean = false)\n        Control -&gt; Oferta: expirar()\n        activate Oferta #5B9BD5\n        Oferta --&gt; Control: void (Situação = Expirada)\n        deactivate Oferta\n        \n        Control -&gt; Repo: salvar(Oferta de Encaixe)\n        activate Repo #E76F26\n        Repo --&gt; Control: void\n        deactivate Repo\n        \n        Control --&gt; Tela: erro(Indisponível)\n        Tela --&gt; User: exibirErro()\n    end\n    \nelse Cliente recusa (UC-047)\n    User -&gt; Tela: recusarOferta()\n    Tela -&gt; Control: processarRecusa()\n    \n    Control -&gt; Oferta: recusar()\n    activate Oferta #5B9BD5\n    Oferta --&gt; Control: void (Situação = Recusada)\n    deactivate Oferta\n    \n    Control -&gt; Repo: salvar(Oferta de Encaixe)\n    activate Repo #E76F26\n    Repo --&gt; Control: void\n    deactivate Repo\n    \n    Control -&gt; Control: processarFilaEspera() (Próximo)\n    \n    Control --&gt; Tela: sucesso\n    Tela --&gt; User: exibirCancelamento()\n    \nelse Tempo Expira (UC-054)\n    Cron -&gt; Control: verificarOfertas()\n    \n    Control -&gt; Oferta: expirar()\n    activate Oferta #5B9BD5\n    Oferta --&gt; Control: void (Situação = Expirada)\n    deactivate Oferta\n    \n    Control -&gt; Repo: salvar(Oferta de Encaixe)\n    activate Repo #E76F26\n    Repo --&gt; Control: void\n    deactivate Repo\n    \n    Control -&gt; Control: processarFilaEspera() (Próximo)\n    \n    deactivate Control\n    deactivate Tela\nend\n\n@enduml&quot;, &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;}" id="uml"><mxCell style="shape=image;noLabel=1;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/svg+xml,;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="2096" height="1961" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>